   \]  
   \[
   14 = x \left( \frac{15 - 3 - 10}{15} \right)
   \]  
   \[
   14 = \frac{2}{15}x
   \]  
8. Solve for \( x \):  
   \[
   x = 14 \times \frac{15}{2} = 7 \times 15 = 105
   \]  
