Thus, $z = -\frac{\sqrt{3}}{6} - \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}i$. The conjugate of $z$ is $\overline{z} = -\frac{\sqrt{3}}{6} + \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}i$.

