\[
aD_t^\alpha f(t) = \frac{1}{\Gamma(n - \alpha)} \frac{d^n}{dt^n} \left( \frac{1}{a} \int_0^t (t - \tau)^{n - \alpha - 1} f(\tau) d\tau \right),
\]

where \( n = \text{Trunc.}[\alpha] + 1 \neq \alpha \) and \( \text{Trunc.} \) denotes the truncated value.

