\]

Now, we can calculate the work done:

\[
W = -nRT \ln \left( \frac{V_2}{V_1} \right) = -2 \times 0.0821 \times 48.8 \ln \left( \frac{8}{4} \right)
\]

\[
W = -2 \times 0.0821 \times 48.8 \ln(2) = -0.82 \times 48.8 \times 0.693 \approx -27.5 \text{ L·atm}
\]

