","To determine the optimal dopant concentration for a thermoelectric material to achieve the maximum thermal coefficient of power (ZT) at a given temperature range, we need to consider the interplay between the Seebeck coefficient (S), electrical conductivity (σ), and thermal conductivity (κ) that determine the ZT value.

