   \[
   0.56 = 1 - \frac{1}{r^{0.4}} \implies \frac{1}{r^{0.4}} = 0.44 \implies r^{0.4} = \frac{1}{0.44} \approx 2.273
   \]
   Taking natural logarithms:
   \[
   0.4 \ln r = \ln 2.273 \approx 0.821
   \]
   \[
